@startuml Hinh_2_5_Sequence_UC_AI_01_Luyen_phat_am_Shadowing
title Hình 2.5: Biểu đồ tuần tự Luyện phát âm Shadowing qua dịch vụ âm học và AI (UC-AI-01)
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 16
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 110

actor "Học viên" as Student
participant "React Frontend\n(Shadowing Studio)" as FE
participant "AiLabController" as AiCtrl
participant "ShadowingService" as ShadowSvc
participant "Python FastAPI\n(:8000 Phonetics)" as PyFastAPI
participant "Groq Whisper\n(STT Cloud)" as GroqSTT
participant "Gemini 2.5\n(Phonetics AI)" as GeminiAI
participant "MySQL DB\n(evaluations)" as DB
participant "WebSocket\n(/topic/student)" as STOMP

Student -> FE: Đọc to câu mẫu & kết thúc thu âm (Web Audio)
FE -> AiCtrl: POST /api/v1/ai/speaking/shadowing-evaluate\n(Tệp WAV 16kHz & Câu mẫu)
AiCtrl -> ShadowSvc: evaluateShadowing(audio, answerId, sentence)

alt Tầng 1: Phân tích âm học qua Python FastAPI
    ShadowSvc -> PyFastAPI: POST /api/v1/audio/evaluate-phonetics
    PyFastAPI -> PyFastAPI: VAD kiểm tra SNR -> Wav2Vec2 CTC\nPraat đo Formant F1/F2 & GOP
    PyFastAPI --> ShadowSvc: HTTP 200 JSON (GOP, Formant, IPA)
    ShadowSvc -> ShadowSvc: EvaluatedBy = "PYTHON_ACOUSTIC_ENGINE"
else Tầng 2 Fallback: Groq Whisper STT + Gemini 2.5 Flash
    ShadowSvc -> GroqSTT: POST /v1/audio/transcriptions (WAV)
    GroqSTT --> ShadowSvc: Transcript bóc băng (< 800ms)
    ShadowSvc -> GeminiAI: evaluateWithAi(Cambridge Rules, prompt)
    GeminiAI --> ShadowSvc: JSON điểm số, mảng màu từ & IPA
    ShadowSvc -> ShadowSvc: EvaluatedBy = "GEMINI_AI_FALLBACK"
end

ShadowSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO ai_evaluations\n(overall_score, stt_transcript, engine)
ShadowSvc -> DB: UPDATE student_answers SET eval_feedback = ...
ShadowSvc -> DB: UPDATE student_skill_profiles\nSET speaking_score = ... (Radar)
ShadowSvc -> STOMP: convertAndSend(/topic/student/{id}/evaluation)
STOMP --> FE: Đẩy kết quả tức thì qua WebSocket
FE --> Student: Hiển thị Review Mode\n(Tô màu từ, âm vị IPA, Formant)
@enduml